WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.460
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:07.960
and I'm finally able to tell you about something that we have been working on for over a year.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.280
This is CLOAK.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.420
Now CLOAK is our

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.170
...clothing...

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:14.670
...brand

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:21.100
This is something that we've been working on for a long time because we wanted to make clothing that we were proud... to tell you about.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:25.080
We decided that we wanted to make something-- and by the way when I say we,

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:30.200
I mean Jacksepticeye and I, and a team of very smart, very knowledgeable people

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.840
about clothing and how to make a company responsibly-- have put together our

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:37.620
heads to try to make clothing that we would want to wear.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:42.300
Clothes that wasn't just screaming its name at the top of his lungs, clothes that we would be proud to wear.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:47.400
Clothes that we would be proud of where it came from, of who it represented, and who it was for.

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:49.920
And more specifically it's for you.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:52.320
This is something that we wanted to make to be

00:00:52.449 --> 00:00:56.879
accessible to everybody, something that wasn't restricting someone based on what type of person they were

00:00:56.879 --> 00:01:00.498
or what kind of thing they did, is something that people could really identify with.

00:01:00.498 --> 00:01:03.358
They could identify with something that didn't want to really be

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:10.349
identified because the clothing is subtle. What we wanted was something that didn't have huge branding about what it was,

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:15.419
clothes that was inherently high-quality, clothes that fit well, clothes that was comfortable,

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:20.430
clothes that just was something that you could wear every single day and be happy wearing it.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:27.749
We wanted all these things and it's shocking how hard that is to get in clothing today. Every company is so worried about

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:34.640
shouting their brand at the top of their lungs that they kind of forgot about the people that are wearing the clothes in the first place.

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:36.280
We wanted this for you.

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:40.100
And it's not just sweatshirts either. It's a whole bunch of different things.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:48.280
We wanted to make a different assortment of clothes that you could wear in pretty much any circumstance. We got sweatshirts. We've got t-shirts,

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.100
obviously, we've got this which is...

00:01:51.579 --> 00:01:55.169
A long-sleeve zip up kind of athletic wear kind of thing.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:56.890
And as you can see on all these things,

00:01:56.890 --> 00:02:02.369
it's not overtly branded. Everything about this company is about hiding in plain sight.

00:02:02.369 --> 00:02:05.938
We wanted to have these subtle logos and I love this logo, by the way,

00:02:05.939 --> 00:02:07.829
because it's just so simple and nice.

00:02:07.829 --> 00:02:09.460
We wanted to have things that

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:15.900
people could really enjoy, things that were comfortable, things that fit well, things that weren't going to fall apart on you on the

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:18.450
second wear. We wanted clothing...

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:20.480
for you.

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:25.560
you can go to cloakbrand.com right now to check out what we have, but it is for

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:29.460
